---

## OPTION A — IMAGE SEQUENCE SCROLL

Use when the subject needs frame-by-frame transformation.

Examples:

* Clothing movement
* Perfume bottle assembly
* Car rotation
* Product transformation
* Furniture assembly
* Product reveal

Architecture:

```text
Long scroll section
        ↓
Sticky viewport
        ↓
Canvas
        ↓
Local image sequence
        ↓
Scroll progress controls frame
```

---

## OPTION B — VIDEO SCROLL

Use when continuous cinematic movement is more appropriate.

Use:

* Scroll-controlled video
* Video scrubbing
* Poster image
* Lazy loading
* Mobile fallback

---

## OPTION C — PARALLAX STORYTELLING

Use for:

* Fashion
* Architecture
* Photography
* Editorial
* Luxury brands
* Portfolios

Create depth using:

* foreground
* subject
* background
* typography

moving at different speeds.

