# ============================================================

# 10. FRAME CONFIGURATION

# ============================================================

Keep frame configuration in one place.

Example:

```ts
export const animationConfig = {
  framePath: "/frames",
  frameCount: 120,
  frameExtension: "webp",
  framePadding: 3,
};
```

For:

```text
framePadding: 3
```

the filenames are:

```text
001.webp
002.webp
003.webp
...
120.webp
```

For:

```text
framePadding: 4
```

the filenames are:

```text
0001.webp
0002.webp
0003.webp
...
0120.webp
```

The animation component must dynamically construct filenames.

Do NOT hardcode individual image names.

